[[3,47,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2891847\">5050B32</a>\n                                           (right and left)</p><p><a href=\"#/2892256\">7055A18</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/2892198\">7040H30</a>\n                                           (right\nand left).</p><p>1. Undo the external bolts.</p><p>2. Undo the internal bolt from bolt sides.</p><p>3. Disconnect the electrical connections for the main beam headlamps.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>Left main beam</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890286\">F12</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>Right main beam</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890289\">F13</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>4. Save the trim.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035846.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,47,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the trim is undamaged.</p><p>Connect the electrical connections to the\nmain beam headlamps.</p><p>Fit the trim in its seating.</p><p>Tighten the internal and external bolts.</p><p><a href=\"#/2892198\">7040H30</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/2892256\">7055A18</a>\n                                           .</p><p><strong>- 5050B34 windscreen wiper arm/s complete with blade - r+r</strong>\n                                           (right\nand left)</p>"]]